join Player left
placeholder: Huh? Whats this thing?
leave --All--
There seems to be a small display with a dead battery icon.
leave --All--
if ResourceManager.battery_amount >= 2:
	set 
	- Use batteries
		[signal arg="minus_batteries"]
		The batteries fit in perfectly.
		join "lil fella" right
		"lil fella": *BZZT* Hello, I am your personal robot companion. How may I assist you today?
		leave --All--
		join Player left
		placeholder: I'm sorry...?
		leave --All--
		join "lil fella" right
		"lil fella": Sorry, I have to say that every time. *BZZT* So, what's the occasion for waking me--
		update "lil fella" (confused)
		"lil fella": Wait, huh? What happened to this place?
		"lil fella": It used to be one of the most populated cities in the province, and now everything is boarded up and crumbling apart!
		leave --All--
		join Player left
		placeholder: Well don't ask me, I woke up from a cryochamber literally 10 minutes ago, I have no idea what happened.
		placeholder: But I am trying to get to the city, and I need to find some parts for a hover board. Do you know if there's any scraps nearby?
		leave --All--
		join "lil fella" right
		update "lil fella" (happy)
		"lil fella": Hmmm, scraps... scraps...
		"lil fella": If I remember correctly, theres usually a lot of spare parts on the north side of town, and theres that arcade.
		update "lil fella" (surprised)
		"lil fella": Come on, let's go!
		update "lil fella" (happy)
		"lil fella": ...
		"lil fella": Uhh, I think you might have to carry me. I don't exactly have legs.
		leave --All--
	- Don't use batteries
		You were always the selfish one, weren't you?
[signal arg="end_of_convo"]
